  "importPrompt": {
    "template": "From our entire conversation history about my finances, generate a\nMarkdown summary I'm going to import into my personal finance app.\nDon't invent figures we haven't discussed — if something isn't clear or I\ndidn't mention it, say so explicitly instead of guessing. Follow this\nstructure:\n\n## Accounts\nFor each bank, savings, cash, or credit card account:\n- Name, institution, type (checking/savings/cash/credit card)\n- Current balance (what I have, or what I currently owe if it's a card)\n- If it's a credit card: credit limit, annual interest rate, closing date,\n  payment due date\n\n## Debts with an active payment plan\nDebts I'm paying regularly:\n- Name, creditor, current balance, original amount (if it changed due to a\n  settlement/discount)\n- Installment amount, frequency (weekly/biweekly/monthly), payment day\n- Total and paid installments if applicable, interest rate if applicable\n\n## Debts with no payment plan\nDebts that exist but don't have organized payments yet:\n- Name, creditor, current balance, relevant notes\n\n## Recurring expenses, subscriptions, and fixed income\nThings that get charged or received periodically and aren't a debt with a\nbalance:\n- Name, amount, frequency, account it moves from/to\n- Closest matching category from this list: {{categories}}\n\n## Notes and open questions\nAnything ambiguous or that we discussed without arriving at a clear figure.\n\nIf you don't have information for a section, write \"No data\" instead of\nomitting it. Don't add explanations outside of these sections."
  },
